# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3dHome - .dockerignore
#
# The Dockerfile copies the repo into the nginx web root, so anything left here
# is SERVED to every visitor. This file keeps development material, docs and
# git history out of the image - smaller build context, smaller attack surface.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Version control -------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Docs and project material (not part of the running app) ---------------
docs
PLAN.md
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE

# --- Dev / CI tooling ------------------------------------------------------
scripts
node_modules
npm-debug.log
package-lock.json

# --- Never ship: local config holds the Home Assistant token ---------------
config.js
config.json
secrets.json
*secrets*.json
.env
.env.*
*.local.*

# --- Never ship: private house profiles ------------------------------------
# The demo house is re-included; a real house is mounted as a volume at run
# time, never baked into the image.
houses/*
!houses/demo
!houses/schema.json

# --- Renders / artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
.playwright-mcp
screenshots

# --- Editor and OS noise ---------------------------------------------------
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
__pycache__
